B.abB=new A.e("What is the three-color sequence of Raynaud's phenomenon in scleroderma?",B.Te,1,"Raynaud's follows the classic sequence: white (pallor from vasospasm/ischemia), blue (cyanosis from deoxygenated static blood), and red (rubor from reperfusion hyperemia when vessels relax).")
