B.abA=new A.e("What is the leading cause of death in children over one year of age in the United States?",B.RH,2,"TBI is the leading cause of death in children over one year of age, with a death rate five times that of leukemia.")
B.S4=s(["20 to 30%","40 to 50%","50 to 60%","70 to 80%"],t.s)
