B.a5d=new A.e("In stroke rehabilitation, the strongest predictor of functional outcome is:",B.N2,1,"Initial stroke severity (as measured by NIHSS or initial functional status) is the strongest predictor of functional outcome. While age and time to rehab admission matter, the severity of the initial neurological deficit is most predictive.")
