B.a9X=new A.e("The optimal time to begin inpatient rehabilitation after stroke is:",B.Xg,2,"Current guidelines recommend beginning inpatient rehabilitation as soon as the patient is medically stable and can participate in at least 3 hours of therapy per day. Earlier initiation is associated with better outcomes, but the patient must be stable.")
