B.a4K=new A.e("For every 10\xb0F increase in skin temperature, what happens to tissue metabolic demand?",B.VN,2,"Every 10\xb0F increase doubles metabolic demand. This explains why heat is contraindicated in arterial insufficiency.")
B.Zm=s(["It causes pain","It increases metabolic demand but stenotic arteries cannot deliver additional blood, causing ischemia","It promotes clot formation","It causes nerve damage"],t.s)
B.aaE=new A.e("Why is heat strictly contraindicated in arterial insufficiency?",B.Zm,1,"Heat doubles metabolic demand but hardened stenotic arteries cannot dilate to meet it, creating a supply-demand mismatch leading to ischemia.")
