B.a51=new A.e("At what temperature does tissue damage from heat begin?",B.Qs,2,"Tissue damage begins at 113-122\xb0F (45-50\xb0C) where proteins denature and thermal necrosis occurs.")
B.Ut=s(["Heat alone was sufficient","Stretching alone was more effective","The combination significantly increased tendon extensibility vs either alone","No difference between groups"],t.s)
B.aa6=new A.e("What did research show about the combined use of heat and stretching on tendons?",B.Ut,2,"Combined heat and stretching significantly increases tendon extensibility compared to either alone \u2014 plastic deformation requires heat plus stretch.")
B.Tt=s(["Decreased viscosity","Increased nerve conduction velocity","Increased blood flow","Decreased heart rate"],t.s)
B.aas=new A.e("Which is NOT one of the four main physiological effects of thermotherapy?",B.Tt,3,"The four effects are: decreased viscosity, increased nerve conduction velocity, increased blood flow (vasodilation), and increased collagen extensibility.")
