B.a6H=new A.e("A posterolateral disc herniation at L4-L5 will most commonly compress which nerve root?",B.RC,2,"In the lumbar spine, posterolateral disc herniations compress the traversing (lower) nerve root. An L4-L5 disc herniates into the L5 nerve root. A far lateral (foraminal) herniation would compress the exiting (upper) root \u2014 L4 in this case.")
B.SW=s(["0-20\xb0","30-70\xb0","80-90\xb0","Any angle"],t.s)
