B.aao=new A.e("The S1 nerve root is tested by which deep tendon reflex?",B.QS,1,"S1 = Achilles reflex, ankle plantarflexion, eversion. L4 = patellar reflex, knee extension. S1 radiculopathy is the most common lumbar radiculopathy (L5-S1 disc is the most commonly herniated lumbar disc).")
