B.a9P=new A.e("In quiet standing, the line of gravity falls in what position relative to the knee joint?",B.Nc,1,"The line of gravity falls anterior to the knee in quiet standing, creating an extension moment without constant quad activity.")
B.WF=s(["Flat feet","Training errors (too much, too far, too fast)","Improper shoe selection","Muscle weakness"],t.s)
B.a8o=new A.e("What is the most common cause of foot problems in runners?",B.WF,1,"The number one cause is training errors \u2014 the rule of twos: too much, too far, too fast.")
B.Y4=s(["Three forces in the same direction","One central force and two distal counterforces","Two parallel and one perpendicular force","Three forces at 120-degree angles"],t.s)
