B.XH=s(["Posterior to the ankle","Through the center","Anterior to the ankle","Lateral to the ankle"],t.s)
B.a7R=new A.e("In quiet standing, the line of gravity falls where relative to the ankle?",B.XH,2,"The line of gravity falls 1-2 inches anterior to the ankle, creating a dorsiflexion moment requiring constant calf muscle activity.")
