B.a8V=new A.e("How many core functions of an orthosis are identified?",B.Wx,2,"9 core functions: pain reduction, deformity prevention/correction, support, function, augmenting weak muscles, controlling spastic muscles, limiting ROM, unloading joints, and kinesthetic reminder.")
