B.Zw=s(["They worsen significantly","They remain unchanged","They stop completely","They convert to tremor"],t.s)
B.a3S=new A.e("What happens to involuntary movements in dyskinetic CP when the child is sound asleep?",B.Zw,2,'The "sleep sign": in dyskinetic CP, involuntary movements vanish completely during deep sleep because the basal ganglia go offline.')
