B.TP=s(["Absent","Decreased","Preserved (normal)","Hyperesthetic"],t.s)
B.a9Y=new A.e("In tarsal tunnel syndrome, heel sensation is typically:",B.TP,2,"Heel sensation is preserved in tarsal tunnel syndrome because the calcaneal branch exits proximal to the tarsal tunnel. If the heel is numb, consider S1 radiculopathy or a more proximal tibial nerve lesion instead.")
B.V_=s(["Femoral nerve","Obturator nerve","Lateral femoral cutaneous nerve","Saphenous nerve"],t.s)
